- byte 1→(1, -64, 0)
- byte 15→(15, -64, 0)- end of the first row
- byte 16→(0, -64, 1)- next row back
- byte 255→(15, -64, 15)- floor is full
- byte 256→(0, -63, 0)- up one
- byte 4095→(15, -49, 15)- section is full
- byte 4096→(0, -48, 0)- next section up, still the same chunk column
- byte 4096 * 24→(16, -64, 0)- the whole column is full (24 sections), move one chunk over
- byte 4096 * 24 * 32→(0, -64, 16)- that row of chunks is full, wrap in z
